{
    "title": "Olamet - Video Chat Online",
    "description": "Within Olamet, you will find funny and exciting people around the world. \r\n\r\nIt's up to you who and what you want to talk about face to face!\r\n\r\nDo you want to meet new friends? Chat with someone cool? Video chat with people worldwide?\r\nDownload Olamet to start chat now!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\u00b7 Meet and Chat: Find New Friends Worldwide\r\nYou can use Olamet to find new people and start video chat with them instantly. Spare your boring time while meeting interesting people all over the world.\r\n\r\n\u00b7 More than video chat: Communicate The Way You Want\r\nLike someone, text someone, video chat someone and send your gifts to make a surprise. You can also watch short videos of your favorites.\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Extreme Video Quality: Great Video Chat Experience\r\nGreat video quality, clear sound and extreme smooth make your video chat experience fantastic. It's like talk to each other in real life!\r\n\r\n\u00b7 Real-time Translation: No Barrier in Worldwide Chat\r\nIn Olamet, you will never miss a chance to chat with them because of the language barrier anymore. Click the translation button to break the language barrier in both video or message chat easily.\r\n\r\nPrivacy We Care:\r\n\u00b7Private and safe chats\r\n\u00b7Report or block users that are acting against our policy\r\n\u00b7Please respect other users and follow our guidelines to keep Olamet clean\r\n\r\nSubscription Service Conditions:\r\n\u00b7The cost of the optional subscription for Olamet VIP that is 9.99 USD for 1 month.\r\n\u00b7Payment will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase.\r\n\u00b7Your subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\u00b7Your account will be charged for renewal within the 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.\r\n\u00b7You can manage your subscription and switch off auto-renewal by accessing your Account Settings after purchase.\r\n\u00b7You cannot cancel your current subscription during the active subscription period.\r\n\u00b7All personal data is handled under the terms and conditions of Olamet privacy policy.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe sincerely hope you'll enjoy using Olamet Live Video Chatting App!\r\nHave fun!\r\nWe are an application similar to chamet, tango, Poppo Live, HoneyCam, and hawa.\r\nWe are constantly improving our app, please contact us if you have any feedback or inquiries!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Within Olamet, you will find funny and exciting people around the world. <br><br>It&#39;s up to you who and what you want to talk about face to face!<br><br>Do you want to meet new friends? Chat with someone cool? Video chat with people worldwide?<br>Download Olamet to start chat now!<br><br>Key Features:<br>\u00b7 Meet and Chat: Find New Friends Worldwide<br>You can use Olamet to find new people and start video chat with them instantly. Spare your boring time while meeting interesting people all over the world.<br><br>\u00b7 More than video chat: Communicate The Way You Want<br>Like someone, text someone, video chat someone and send your gifts to make a surprise. You can also watch short videos of your favorites.<br><br>\u00b7 Extreme Video Quality: Great Video Chat Experience<br>Great video quality, clear sound and extreme smooth make your video chat experience fantastic. It&#39;s like talk to each other in real life!<br><br>\u00b7 Real-time Translation: No Barrier in Worldwide Chat<br>In Olamet, you will never miss a chance to chat with them because of the language barrier anymore. Click the translation button to break the language barrier in both video or message chat easily.<br><br>Privacy We Care:<br>\u00b7Private and safe chats<br>\u00b7Report or block users that are acting against our policy<br>\u00b7Please respect other users and follow our guidelines to keep Olamet clean<br><br>Subscription Service Conditions:<br>\u00b7The cost of the optional subscription for Olamet VIP that is 9.99 USD for 1 month.<br>\u00b7Payment will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase.<br>\u00b7Your subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br>\u00b7Your account will be charged for renewal within the 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.<br>\u00b7You can manage your subscription and switch off auto-renewal by accessing your Account Settings after purchase.<br>\u00b7You cannot cancel your current subscription during the active subscription period.<br>\u00b7All personal data is handled under the terms and conditions of Olamet privacy policy.<br><br><br>We sincerely hope you&#39;ll enjoy using Olamet Live Video Chatting App!<br>Have fun!<br>We are an application similar to chamet, tango, Poppo Live, HoneyCam, and hawa.<br>We are constantly improving our app, please contact us if you have any feedback or inquiries!",
